 docs:[{id:'d1',title:'Company handbook',favorite:true,parent:null,content:'<h2>A little clarity goes a long way.</h2><p>Welcome to Loop. We build thoughtful tools that help people move important work forward.</p><h3>How we work</h3><ul><li>Make the next step clear.</li><li>Write things down so everyone can contribute.</li><li>Leave room for focused work.</li></ul><blockquote>Good work starts with shared context.</blockquote>'},{id:'d2',title:'Product principles',favorite:true,parent:'d1',content:'<h2>Thoughtful by default</h2><p>Make the important things obvious. Every interaction should help someone understand where they are and what comes next.</p><ol><li>Clarity before cleverness.</li><li>Keep people in control.</li><li>Connect the work, not just the tools.</li></ol>'},{id:'d3',title:'Q4 launch brief',favorite:true,parent:null,content:'<p><strong>Owner:</strong> Alex Morgan · <strong>Project:</strong> Website launch</p><h2>A confident first impression.</h2><p>Our launch should show how Loop makes everyday work simpler. The website and onboarding need to tell one continuous story.</p><blockquote>Help people see their next step, then help them take it.</blockquote><h2>What we’re shipping</h2><ul><li>A focused launch page with a clear product story.</li><li>A welcoming first-run experience.</li><li>A practical getting-started guide.</li></ul><h2>Before launch</h2><p>☐ Revise the onboarding copy before the launch review.</p><p>☐ Confirm mobile design approval.</p><p>☐ Review support coverage with Priya.</p>'},{id:'d4',title:'Customer research',favorite:false,parent:null,content:'<h2>Less searching. More doing.</h2><p>Six customer conversations pointed to the same problem: context gets lost between conversations, plans, and decisions.</p><h3>What we heard</h3><ul><li>People need a trustworthy view of their priorities.</li><li>Decisions should stay close to the work they affect.</li><li>AI is most useful when its suggestions are reviewable.</li></ul><h3>Next action</h3><p>Share the interview synthesis with the product team.</p>'},{id:'d5',title:'Weekly product review',favorite:false,parent:'d3',content:'<h2>Launch readiness</h2><p>Review the onboarding story, confirm design direction, and agree on remaining owners.</p><h3>Decision log</h3><p>Keep the welcome screen focused on one primary action.</p>'},{id:'d6',title:'New-hire checklist',favorite:false,parent:'d1',content:'<h2>Your first week</h2><p>☐ Meet your team.</p><p>☐ Read the product principles.</p><p>☐ Set up your workspace.</p><p>☐ Share one thing you would improve.</p>'}],
